          "id": 2827400368,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "The idea is right, but `G_N_ELEMENTS` doesn't work here (it returns 1) because of the way the macro works it has to be something known at compile time (and it will just treat prefix as a `const char * const *` instead of a static array of a known size.)",
