        {
          "id": 2827426745,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "> it has to be something known at compile time\n\nOf course... and this is why I should not try to review and approve changes early in the morning, before I've had any caffeine. :grin:\n\nLast time I looked at this function, I thought that it almost looked worthwhile to put all the parameters for IEC vs. SI into a struct and then just selecting which struct element to use, rather than setting each parameter individually, conditionally.  I might poke around and see if it's a good alternative to this fix.  (Now that I have had some caffeine.)",
